-- הודעת תכ"ם HOD.13.4.2.1 "לוח תעריפי נסיעה בתחבורה ציבורית", מהדורה 13
-- (1.4.2019). The notice rewritten: definitions (the daily and monthly free
-- passes, the combined cards, the existing and the new employee), the
-- allowance by the code reported for the route, the existing employee's
-- regional, daily and intercity tariffs, trips on duty, reporting in
-- Mashcit, and three annexes of tables — by metropolis, the combined cards,
-- the single trips — which are DATA here, written by tools/tariff_l4.py
-- from the corpus and held to it by tests/test_tariffs.py.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `kitzuvat-nesia-common`
IMPORT `taarifei-nesia-common`

-- not weighed against `the Wage Protection Law`: the notice sets the
-- tariffs by which a travel EXPENSE is refunded (‘החזר הוצאה’), not wages.

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘ימי עבודה בפועל’
-- here counts the days whose fares are refunded (3.2.2, 3.2.3), not hours
-- of work or rest.

§ `הודעת תכ"ם 13.4.2.1 לוח תעריפי נסיעה בתחבורה ציבורית — מהדורה 13`

`notice 13 is published` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2019

§§ `1 רקע ומטרה`

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-4 The background (the reform of 1.1.2016, its 14.5% cut of 1.2.2016 and second stage of 1.4.2016, the agreement to soften it for existing employees); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-5 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-5__cls_1-5-1 The notice's purpose; no rule.

§§ `2 הגדרות`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 The Ministry of Transport's site, its maps and calculator; a pointer outside the corpus, no rule.

-- 2.2-2.4: the daily free pass is valid on the day it is bought, in the
-- zone it covers; the monthly free pass for the calendar month; a combined
-- card between metropolitan areas covers the home metropolis, the
-- intercity stretch and the work metropolis, by the month or the day. The
-- tickets are the tables' columns (`fare ticket`); the combined card is
-- annex B's.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4
`the tickets notice 13 defines` MEANS LIST `a daily free pass`, `a monthly free pass`

-- 2.5: an existing employee was employed in a ministry or an auxiliary unit
-- on 31.12.2015; so is one employed that day whose employment was broken
-- afterwards for up to 6 months and resumed (counted as continuous), or who
-- moved to another ministry or auxiliary unit, or home.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-2
GIVEN `employed on 31.12.2015` IS A BOOLEAN
      `months the employment was broken since` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 where it never was
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing employee under notice 13` `employed on 31.12.2015` `months the employment was broken since` IF
    `employed on 31.12.2015` AND `months the employment was broken since` AT MOST 6

-- 2.6: a new employee, taken in from 1.1.2016, is paid by the monthly free
-- pass alone.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6
`a new employee under notice 13 is paid by` MEANS `a monthly free pass`

-- 2.7: hourly employees and students are as the instruction "תשלום קצובת
-- נסיעה" defines them; it names the instruction "מס' 13.4.0.2", which is no
-- instruction's number — the instruction of that name is 13.4.2 (finding
-- F-…v13-b).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-7
`the instruction notice 13 cites for hourly employees and students` MEANS "13.4.0.2"
`the number of the instruction "תשלום קצובת נסיעה"` MEANS "13.4.2"
`notice 13 cites the travel instruction by a number it does not bear` MEANS
    NOT `the instruction notice 13 cites for hourly employees and students` EQUALS `the number of the instruction "תשלום קצובת נסיעה"`
#ASSERT `notice 13 cites the travel instruction by a number it does not bear`

§§ `3.1 כללי`

-- akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1 The heading "כללי"; its clauses follow.

-- 3.1.1 and 3.1.3: the allowance is paid by the code reported for the
-- employee, at the monthly free pass of the card the code names (annex A).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-3
GIVEN code IS A STRING, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's monthly allowance for the code` code d IS
    `the fare for the code` `notice 13's fares` code `a monthly free pass` d

-- 3.1.4: home in one metropolis and work in another: the combined card's
-- code (annex B), its monthly free pass.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-4
GIVEN code IS A STRING, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's allowance between metropolitan areas` code d IS
    `the fare for the code` `notice 13's fares` code `a monthly free pass` d

-- 3.1.2: the salary accountant finds the code on the Ministry's calculator
-- and reports it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `finding and reporting the code, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `find the route's tariff code or distance on the Ministry of Transport's calculator`
    HENCE (PARTY `the salary accountant`
           MUST  `report the route's tariff code in the payroll`)

-- 3.1.5: the existing employee is marked by population code 604 in event
-- 120: marked for the rules below, the allowance by postcodes and the
-- travel advance (849) stopped.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-5 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-5__pnt_3-1-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-5__pnt_3-1-5-2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-5__pnt_3-1-5-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `marking an existing employee, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `report the existing-employee population code`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Malam payroll service`
           MUST  `stop the postcode calculation and the travel advance`)

§§ `3.2 קצובת נסיעה לעובדים קיימים`

-- akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2/p2 The heading and its lead-in; the cases follow.

-- 3.2.1: home and work in one zone of the metropolis: the regional monthly
-- free pass.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-1
GIVEN code IS A STRING, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's allowance within one zone` code d IS
    `notice 13's monthly allowance for the code` code d

-- 3.2.2: home and work in different zones of one metropolis: the daily
-- free pass times the days actually worked, and no less than the monthly
-- free pass; where no days are reported, the monthly.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-2
GIVEN daily IS A NUMBER, monthly IS A NUMBER
      `days actually worked` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's allowance for several zones of one metropolis` daily monthly `days actually worked` IS
    CONSIDER `days actually worked`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN monthly
    WHEN JUST days THEN max (daily TIMES days) monthly

-- 3.2.3: home and work in different metropolitan areas: the monthly free
-- pass in the home zone and in the work zone, and the single fare of the
-- line between them, there and back ("הלוך ושוב"), for the days actually
-- worked — where the employee was paid intercity travel by the days up to
-- 31.12.2015 (3.2.3.1) or moved after 1.1.2016 and must travel intercity
-- (3.2.3.2); reported by three codes (3.2.3.3-3.2.3.5), as the example of
-- Tel Aviv and Jerusalem shows (3.2.3.6). 3.4: one who moved nearer and
-- stopped travelling intercity is paid none.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-2/p2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-4 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-5 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-6 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-6__pnt_3-2-3-6-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-6__pnt_3-2-3-6-2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2__cls_3-2-3__pnt_3-2-3-6__pnt_3-2-3-6-3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-4
GIVEN `home code` IS A STRING, `work code` IS A STRING, `line code` IS A STRING
      d IS A DATE
      `days actually worked` IS A NUMBER
      `paid intercity by the days up to 31.12.2015 or moved since` IS A BOOLEAN
      `still travels intercity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's intercity allowance of an existing employee` `home code` `work code` `line code` d `days actually worked` `paid intercity by the days up to 31.12.2015 or moved since` `still travels intercity` IS
    CONSIDER `the fare for the code` `notice 13's fares` `home code` `a monthly free pass` d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST home THEN
        CONSIDER `the fare for the code` `notice 13's fares` `work code` `a monthly free pass` d
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST work THEN
            IF NOT (`paid intercity by the days up to 31.12.2015 or moved since` AND `still travels intercity`)
            THEN JUST (home PLUS work)
            ELSE CONSIDER `the fare for the code` `notice 13's fares` `line code` `a single trip` d
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                 WHEN JUST single THEN JUST (home PLUS work PLUS `the single fares a day of an intercity round trip` TIMES single TIMES `days actually worked`)

-- 3.3: an employee paid for intercity travel signs a periodic declaration
-- that the trips were made; the salary accountant prepares it where the
-- attendance is not kept in ESS.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `declaring the intercity trips, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `have the employees sign the declaration`
    HENCE (PARTY `the government employee`
           MUST  `sign a periodic declaration of the intercity trips made`)

@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `changing the codes on a move nearer, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `report codes for the new address`

§§ `4 נסיעות בתפקיד`

-- 4.1: trips on duty out of town, by an employee with a service car beyond
-- its approved quota (up to 1,000 shekels a month) or one with no car
-- standard, are refunded on report at single fares, or at the daily free
-- pass where no single fare is set. 4.2 points to annex C's single fares.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-1 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-2
GIVEN `the fares of the trips on duty` IS A NUMBER @desc the single fares of the trips reported, or the daily free pass where the route has no single fare (annex C)
      `has a service car beyond its quota` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 13's refund for trips on duty` `the fares of the trips on duty` `has a service car beyond its quota` IS
    IF `has a service car beyond its quota`
    THEN min `the fares of the trips on duty` 1000
    ELSE `the fares of the trips on duty`

§§ `5 אופן הדיווח`

-- akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-2 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3 The headings of the three stages; their clauses follow.

-- 5.1-5.3: the code is taken from the Ministry's calculator, reported in
-- event 225 (by the code, or through the help window), and the existing
-- employee's mark in event 120.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-1__cls_5-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-1__cls_5-1-2 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-1__cls_5-1-3 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-2__cls_5-2-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-2__cls_5-2-2 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-2__cls_5-2-3 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-2__cls_5-2-4 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-2 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `reporting the code in Mashcit, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `find the route's tariff code or distance on the Ministry of Transport's calculator`
    HENCE (PARTY `the salary accountant`
           MUST  `report the route's tariff code in the payroll`
           HENCE (PARTY `the salary accountant`
                  MUST  `report the existing-employee population code`))

-- 5.3.4: no code on the calculator means two metropolitan areas: the
-- combined card's code (annex B), or, for an existing employee, 3.2.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-4 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-4__pnt_5-3-4-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-3__cls_5-3-4__pnt_5-3-4-2
GIVEN `the calculator gives a code` IS A BOOLEAN, `an existing employee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the code notice 13 reports` `the calculator gives a code` `an existing employee` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the calculator gives a code` THEN "the calculator's code"
        IF `an existing employee` THEN "three codes, 3.2.3"
        OTHERWISE "the combined card between the metropolitan areas, annex B"

-- 5.4: a raised refund for a national-priority locality, by the locality's
-- code (event 018), made by the payroll automatically; the amount is the
-- instruction's (H.13.4.2).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-4 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-4__cls_5-4-1 akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-4__cls_5-4-2
`the raised cap of notice 13` MEANS `set elsewhere` "הוראת תכ\"ם 13.4.2"

@ref akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-4__cls_5-4-1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `raising the cap automatically, notice 13` IS
    PARTY `the Malam payroll service`
    MUST  `raise the refund cap for a national-priority locality`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_5__subpara_5-4__cls_5-4-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `reporting an existing employee, notice 13` IS `marking an existing employee, notice 13`

