-- The table of Dan's northern lines is titled a monthly free pass ("לוח
-- מחירי "חופשי חודשי" – צפון חברת דן") and its header and prices are single
-- trips ("מחיר מלא בש"ח לנסיעה בודדת"). The header is read (finding
-- F-…v13-a).
`notice 13's Dan north table is titled monthly and prices single trips` MEANS
        `notice 13's fare table 20`'s `fare table title` EQUALS "לוח מחירי \"חופשי חודשי\" – צפון חברת דן"
    AND all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `column ticket` EQUALS JUST `a single trip`) (`notice 13's fare table 20`'s `fare table columns`)
#ASSERT `notice 13's Dan north table is titled monthly and prices single trips`

